            <p>It goes live. Add care if you want us to keep watch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 06 WORKING WITH US -->
    <section id="working" style="padding-top:20px">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="head">
          <div class="label">06 · Working with us</div>
          <h2>Real people, not a ticket queue.</h2>
          <p class="sub">You'll always know who to call, and you'll get a straight answer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ways">
          <div class="way glass">
            <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">◎</div>
            <h3>We come to you</h3>
            <p>Your audit happens at your business, on your schedule, so we see how your day really runs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="way glass">
            <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">✆</div>
            <h3>A direct line</h3>
            <p>Call or text the people doing the work. No call centers, no support tickets.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="way glass">
            <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">¶</div>
            <h3>Plain language</h3>
            <p>No tech jargon. We explain what we're building, why, and what it costs before we start.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="way glass">
            <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">↻</div>
            <h3>We check in</h3>
            <p>After launch, we check in to see what's working and what to add to your dashboard next.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTACT -->
    <section id="contact" class="contact">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="label c">Get started</div>
        <h2>Book your free audit.</h2>
        <p class="sub">
          <span class="sub-wide"
            >30 minutes at your business. No obligation. Next, you'll pick what you'd like built so we
            can prep before we meet.</span
          ><span class="sub-phone"
            >30 minutes at your business. No obligation. Send this once and we'll call or text within one
            business day to pick a time.</span
          >
        </p>
        <!-- wider screens: the original two-step form (step 2 is /plan.html) -->
        <form id="lead" class="glass" novalidate>
          <div class="two">
            <label class="fld"
              ><span>Your name</span><input id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label
