              placeholder="Or what would you want on your dashboard?"></textarea></label
          >
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Book my free audit</button>
          <p class="consent">
            We'll use your details only to set up your audit, and we may call, text or email you about it.
            Reply STOP to any text to stop. Msg &amp; data rates may apply. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
          </p>
          <div id="formerr" role="alert">
            Add your name, business name and an email or phone so we can reach you.
          </div>
          <div id="thanks" role="status">
            <p>Got it. Next, pick what you'd like us to build.</p>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" id="toPlan" href="/plan.html">Continue to step 2</a>
          </div>
        </form>
        <!-- phones: the one-step form -->
        <div class="contact-phone"><LeadForm id="cf" /></div>
        <div class="direct">
          <div class="dline">
            <span class="dl">Call or text</span><a class="sel" id="c-phone" href="tel:+18189397964"
            >(818) 939-7964</a
            ><button class="copy" data-copy="(818) 939-7964" type="button">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div class="dline">
            <span class="dl">Email</span><a class="sel" id="c-email" href="mailto:beng@futureclaritytechnologies.com"
            >beng@futureclaritytechnologies.com</a
            ><button class="copy" data-copy="beng@futureclaritytechnologies.com" type="button">Copy</button>
          </div>
